      "writtenOn": "2018-07-27T07:08:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve left these asserts for now, as I thought they serve some purpose as documentation. Should I  convert them into a comment, or just do away with the whole lot? Is there some preferred way to document preconditions like this without doing an actual assert?",
      "revId": "d41ec856b02f5b0e89d3e8822989f6f47cea9a9b",
